From: noamtu123 <noamtu123@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 12:13:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] debuggerd: Make the crash dumper available in recovery

Enable the existing recovery variant so crash_dump64 can emit a native
backtrace when the recovery process crashes. Retain the existing module
implementation and its shared dependencies.

Adapt the recovery debug kit to request only the crash dumper. Logcat is
already enabled; no strace or tombstoned service is added to X00TD.

Signed-off-by: ikwfahmi <mikhwanfahmi4@gmail.com>
Change-Id: I98a0f1977e35fd7f93ed92cc9f088533415df5cd

--- a/debuggerd/Android.bp
+++ b/debuggerd/Android.bp
@@ -366,6 +366,7 @@
 
 cc_binary {
     name: "crash_dump",
+    recovery_available: true,
     srcs: [
         "crash_dump.cpp",
         "util.cpp",
